✈️ ABC Holidays — Website Analytics Case Study

From raw clickstream to boardroom insight: SQL sessionization → star schema → Power BI dashboard.


📌 Overview

ABC Holidays, a UK travel website, had a flat clickstream file and one question: why aren't visitors booking?
This project models 38,097 page views (1–8 June 2022) into a clean analytical model, builds an interactive Power BI report, and turns the findings into clear, prioritised recommendations for the website owner.

The raw file has no session ID, no page type, no channel and no funnel stage. Everything analytical was derived from two free-text URL columns.

